# Make line endings deterministic across machines and stop Git's
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings on Windows.
#
# Text files are stored with LF in the repository AND checked out with LF
# everywhere (eol=lf). This is the right default for a Node/Express + static
# web project — browsers, Node, and modern editors all handle LF fine, and it
# overrides a machine-level core.autocrlf=true so the working tree stays LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize or diff these as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.svg  text
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
